# Repo-root Docker builds (e.g. templates/stuck-order-adk) — keep context small
.git
.gitignore
.cursor
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.egg-info
admin-console
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/.terraform
docs
infra/terraform/**/*.tfstate*
run-*.json
agent-transcripts
